  "notes": "That Freekick Challenge is a free kick sandbox game on Roblox made by NelStud. You pick a spot on the pitch, set up the wall, then adjust power, angle, rotation and curve before you strike. You can practice on your own or challenge other players, and coins buy cards that raise stats like Accuracy, Precision, Power and Curl.\n\nCodes here give coins and the odd Perk Point. Coins are the most useful reward because they go straight into cards that make your shots better, while Perk Points unlock skills that help on hard kicks. NelStud has posted new codes around player and visit milestones and with updates, with names like TFC15M pointing to visit counts, and they show up in the NelStud Discord first.",
